## Original Content
See how we made AI agents easy to build, run, and improve in production.

## Summary
Duolingo has created an agent platform that makes AI agents easy to build, run, and improve in production. This platform sets production-ready agents as the default, focusing on reliability and scalability in AI applications.

## Key Points
- Simplification of AI agent building process through a dedicated platform
- Streamlined deployment and continuous improvement of agents in production environments
- Goal of making production-ready agents the standard choice for reliability
- Enhanced scalability and robustness for real-world AI system usage


